"_EQ-0_Scen001_t520s"      : idstring (used in output file names)
"F4E_Scen001_10520.eqdsk"  : magnetic equilibrium file name (G EQDSK format)
"ne_Scen001_t520s.txt"     : ne prof. file name (col 1: norm. psi, col 2: ne in 10^19 m^-3)
"Te_Scen001_t520s.txt"     : Te profile file name (col 1: normalized psi, col 2: Te in keV)
0  "dfunct.data"           : fddtype (edf model: 0=maxw,1=LH tail,2=multi-mawxw,3=multi-maxw w/ relative parameters), edf parameters file name
99 "los_ITER-EL-0.txt"     : ilos (line of sight: 3,-3,-1,0,1,2=[JET new/old KK3,KK1,KK5@0,10,20] 10=EAST other=read file), arbitrary los filename
100.  300.  101            : f1 fn (frequency range, GHz) nfreq (number of frequency values)
1    1    1.               : nrad nang (radial/angular number of rays) rlast (normalized max radius: 1=last shell at beam size)
3.0  3.0  0. 0.  0.        : w0xt w0yt (beam waist, cm) pw0xt pw0yt (waist position, cm, >0 towards plasma) awr (waist rotation, deg)
0.65 0.32           : r p (reflection and scrambling coefficients)
2    2              : iwarm (abs./emiss. model (0=no computation, 1=weakly rel, 2=fully relativistic) ilarm (order of expansion in larmor radius)
-100 1              : imx (max iteration # for dispersion relation convergence) versign (1,2: algorithm for sign choice in dispersion relation)
0.2 8000            : dst (ray integration step in c*t, cm) nsteps (<=8000)
0.001  1.015        : sspld (ne smoothing coefficient, 0=interpolation) psdbnd (norm. psi of plasma boundary)
0.001 -1 0 11 -1 -1 : sspl (psi smoothing coefficient) ixp (plasma configuration: 0=limiter, -1=lower X point, +1=upper X pt, +2=double X) ipsinorm (2D psi units: 0=dimensioned, 1=normalized) icocos (0-18: EQDSK convention on coordinate systems) sgnbphi (Bphi sign, used if icocos=0: -1=CW, +1=CCW) sgniphi (Iphi sign, used if icocos=0: -1=CW, +1=CCW)
1.00 1.00 1.00 1.00 : bfact bvfact nfact tfact (Btot, Bvac, ne, Te: scaling factors)
0    0              : iprtr iptfr (emissivity and ray trajectory data resampling: 0=disable, 1=all, n=output every n ray steps/frequencies)
1    0    0         : idsc iffmt iscatter (id string in 1st EQDSK line: 0=no, 1= yes; EQDSK format: 0=fixed, 1=free; EQDSK data validity: 0=entire grid, 1=only inside LCFS)
0                   : angles convention (0=ITER [alpha beta, default], 1=TCV [theta phi])
1                   : iproj (0=psi projection on [0,1], 1=psi projection on [-1,1])
